    "updated_at": "2018-04-05T06:58:38Z",
    "body": "So every browser excludes Edge?\r\n\r\nhttps://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#extensions-to-the-mouseevent-interface defines some extensions to MouseEvent.\r\n\r\nI think ideally all of these are defined directly as part of https://w3c.github.io/uievents/. Would you mind filing an issue against that specification?\r\n\r\nHTML should probably not also start defining mouse events.",
