    "updated_at": "2018-04-05T07:13:47Z",
    "body": "Thanks: https://github.com/w3c/uievents/issues/new. Since pointer events inherit from the `MouseEvent` interface they would have to consider this automatically, but it probably makes sense to point that out in the issue, that there might be some downstream implications. I wish we had more folks working full time on those standards, they could really use some work.",
